From: txuna <b7712983@naver.com>
Date: Mon, 26 May 2025 13:25:21 +0000
Subject: Fix GH-18595: fpm_get_status segfault

This fixes null dereference error when calling fpm_get_status() and one
of the children is just being created.

Closes GH-18662

Co-authored-by: Jakub Zelenka <bukka@php.net>
